{"id":"n84921-1-10","stage":4,"title":"행방 · 下落","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84921-1-10-1","ko":"편지의 행방을 모르겠네.","zh":"我不知道信去哪儿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"편지의","meaning":"信，书信，信件","explanation":"편지：信，书信，信件；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"편지","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24147","senseId":"1","lemma":"편지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행방을","meaning":"下落，去向，踪迹","explanation":"행방：下落，去向，踪迹；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"행방","audio":"/audio/7ba2c2611d78d6152e67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84921","senseId":"1","lemma":"행방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠네.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"53bf9898bc47c0e1","term":"편지","zh":"信，书信，信件","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3","entryId":"24147","definition":"把要说的话写下来寄给对方的文字内容。","pronunciation":["편ː지"]},{"id":"7ba2c2611d78d615","term":"행방","zh":"下落，去向，踪迹","audio":"/audio/7ba2c2611d78d6152e67.mp3","entryId":"84921","definition":"去的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["행방"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/62eb3bf76805e0a9b22a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84921-1-10-2","ko":"그러게, 어디로 갔을까? 분명히 부친 거지?","zh":"是啊，会跑到哪儿去呢？明明已经寄出去了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게,","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔을까?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분명히","meaning":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","explanation":"분명히：肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","readings":[{"term":"분명히","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71047","senseId":"3","lemma":"분명히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부친","meaning":"寄，汇，邮","explanation":"부치다：寄，汇，邮；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"부치다","audio":"/audio/b3fb1e23969565512601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62365","senseId":"1","lemma":"부치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"5886d7564ad76ada","term":"분명히","zh":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","audio":"/audio/5886d7564ad76ada0d96.mp3","entryId":"71047","definition":"事实准确无误地。","pronunciation":["분명히"]},{"id":"b3fb1e2396956551","term":"부치다","zh":"寄，汇，邮","audio":"/audio/b3fb1e23969565512601.mp3","entryId":"62365","definition":"发送信件或东西等。","pronunciation":["부치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e65aeb46c585a7df995.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.551,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84921","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.3777,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，会跑到哪儿去呢？明明已经寄出去了吧？","我不知道信去哪儿了。","真的太冷了！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不知道信去哪儿了。","真的太冷了！","是啊，会跑到哪儿去呢？明明已经寄出去了吧？"],"answer":2}]}
